[]
access = read : [ admin ], write : [ admin ]
# D-15: global export is REQUIRED. Without it a search command is only
# invocable from the app context that carries it, which makes `| confbtool`
# unusable from the Search app - the only real usage. The effective guard has
# never been visibility but the run-time `run_confbtool` capability check; the
# per-role read ACL above keeps applying to the exported object.
export = system
